# **5. Registration approval system**

Events can use different approval workflows.

| Registration rule       | Behaviour                        |
| ----------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| Open registration       | Automatically confirm            |
| Approval required       | Wait for organiser               |
| Staff approval          | Only authorised officers approve |
| Department approval     | Department officer approves      |
| Invitation only         | Register through invitation      |
| Restricted registration | Eligibility checked              |
| Paid registration       | Payment verification             |
| Free registration       | No payment required              |

